  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pj2:2.1": "The text literally says “the dyers’ spread”, <i lang='pi' translate='no'>rajakattharaṇaṁ</i>, but the commentary at Sp 1.90 qualifies that this refers to their spread of “cloth”, <i lang='pi' translate='no'>vatthāni</i>. ",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pj2:2.2": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pj2:2.3": "",
  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pj2:2.4": "For the rendering of <i lang='pi' translate='no'>cīvara</i> as “robe-cloth”, see Appendix of Technical Terms. ",
